  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello,\n\nI am writing to address a concerning issue regarding the recent Content Gating update. Despite inputting the correct date of birth during registration (and being well above 18 at that time), my account, along with a friend's, is now restricted as if we are under 18.\n\nI've reached out to the support team, but unfortunately, the responses have been unhelpful and dismissive, suggesting to create new accounts. This not only undermines our commitment to the platform but also feels unfair considering the accuracy of our age information.\n\nI kindly request the VRChat team to investigate and rectify this bug promptly. It's essential to acknowledge the frustration and limitations users like me are facing due to the current filter restrictions.\n\nThank you for your attention to this matter.\n\nBest regards,\n\nLusiiky",
